# data-gov-tn-mcp

MCP server for Tunisia's Open Data portal (data.gov.tn).
Read-only, Phase 1. See `docs/architecture.md` for details.

## Setup
\`\`\`bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
cp .env.example .env
python main.py
\`\`\`
